# zsets3 — score ranges: BYSCORE, ZCOUNT and exclusive bounds
#
# Learn: ZRANGE key min max BYSCORE (older: ZRANGEBYSCORE) selects by
# score instead of by position; ZCOUNT key min max counts. Bounds are
# inclusive; prefix one with "(" to make it exclusive, and use -inf/+inf
# for open ends.
#
# Task: the "silver league" is players with MORE THAN 100 points, up to
# and including 200. Print them lowest score first, then print how many
# there are.
#

ZRANGE lb:weekly 100 200 BYSCORE
ZCOUNT lb:weekly 100 200
